    "story": {
      "paragraph": "A group of men surround a luxury car in a parking lot outside a bowling alley at night. One man inside the car looks nervous as the car drives away, leaving another man behind. The man left behind is grabbed by the group. They confront him, and one older man takes a large ring with a yellow stone from another man's finger. The older man pops the stone out of the ring and swallows it while the group chokes and drags the man away. They drag him into the bowling alley and throw him towards the bowling ball return machine.",
